sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Django
  participant T as Route + TransactionalEmail
  participant I as Run intake
  participant K as Intake topic
  participant C as Intake consumer
  participant Q as Job queue
  D->>T: POST send with key
  T->>T: validate, size cap, HMAC fingerprint
  T->>I: recall(run)
  I->>Q: findIdempotencyKey(runId)
  Q-->>I: absent
  T->>T: refusals, time budget
  T->>I: launch acked
  I->>K: encrypted body, key runId (Q1)
  K-->>I: ack, acks=all
  I-->>T: accepted
  T-->>D: 202 invocation_id
  K->>C: batch
  C->>C: decrypt, dedupe by runId (Q2)
  C->>Q: createJobsIdempotently
  Q-->>C: created / replayed / mismatch
  C->>C: lifecycle rows, then store offsets (Q2)
